{
  "name": "tmplat",
  "homepage": "https://tmplat.com",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "task": "clean",
      "input": {
        "files": [
          "@(icon|wordmark|logo|banner)/**/*.ico",
          "@(icon|wordmark|logo|banner)/**/*.min.svg",
          "@(icon|wordmark|logo|banner)/**/*.png"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "task": "convert",
      "input": {
        "files": "@(icon|wordmark|logo)/**/*.svg"
      },
      "output": {
        "format": "png"
      },
      "options": {
        "sizes": [
          16,
          19,
          24,
          32,
          36,
          48,
          64,
          70,
          72,
          76,
          96,
          120,
          128,
          144,
          150,
          152,
          167,
          168,
          180,
          192,
          250,
          256,
          300,
          310,
          512,
          2800
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "task": "convert",
      "input": {
        "files": "banner/**/*.svg"
      },
      "output": {
        "format": "png"
      }
    },
    {
      "task": "package",
      "input": {
        "files": [
          "icon/**/*-16x16.png",
          "icon/**/*-32x32.png",
          "icon/**/*-48x48.png",
          "icon/**/*-256x256.png"
        ]
      },
      "output": {
        "files": "<%= file.base(true).replace(/-(16|32|48|256)x\\1$/, '') %>.ico"
      },
      "options": {
        "groupBy": "<%= file.dir %>",
        "sizes": [
          16,
          32,
          48,
          256
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "task": "optimize",
      "input": {
        "files": "@(icon|wordmark|logo|banner)/**/*.svg"
      }
    }
  ],
  "docs": [
    {
      "doc": "README.md",
      "dir": ".",
      "title": "tmplat branding",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": "This repository contains branding assets and guidelines for [<%= config.title %>](<%= config.homepage %>), a Chrome extension that quickly and easily copies info on the current page using a simple and unique template system."
        },
        {
          "type": "toc",
          "docs": [
            "guidelines.md",
            "colors.md",
            "assets.md"
          ],
          "minDepth": 0,
          "maxDepth": 1
        },
        {
          "title": "The Mark",
          "type": "template",
          "content": [
            "**Stack** &mdash; two offset rounded tiles with the `t` monogram on the front tile: the \"copy this page\" idea, which is exactly what the extension does. The wordmark uses a geometric, monolinear lowercase construction (round caps/joins, single stroke weight) that matches the mark."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Using Assets",
          "type": "template",
          "content": [
            "All assets are owned by the <%= config.title %> project and intended for use in representing it, however, if you wish to use these assets elsewhere, simply ask by raising an issue, detailing who/what/when/where/why you intend to use them.",
            "",
            "The best way to get in touch is by [raising an issue](https://github.com/tmplat-extension/tmplat-branding/issues/new)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Generating Assets",
          "type": "template",
          "content": [
            "The assets and documentation within this repository are generated using [Brander](https://github.com/airmrcr/brander) based on our `.branderrc.json` configuration file.",
            "",
            "To get started, first clone the repository:",
            "",
            "```bash",
            "git clone <%= config.repository.url %> && cd <%= config.repository.name %>",
            "```",
            "",
            "Then install all of the necessary dependencies:",
            "",
            "```bash",
            "npm install",
            "```",
            "",
            "Now you can easily generate all assets and documentation after making whatever changes you want to the configuration file or asset sources:",
            "",
            "```bash",
            "npm start",
            "```",
            "",
            "If successful, it should end with \"Done!\"."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "doc": "assets.md",
      "title": "Assets",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": "This document contains references to all assets that are available to be used to represent the <%= config.title %> brand across all spaces."
        },
        {
          "type": "toc",
          "maxDepth": 1
        },
        {
          "title": "Icons",
          "type": "asset-feature",
          "dir": "icon/**/*/",
          "preview": "!(*.min).svg",
          "files": [
            "*.ico",
            "*.png",
            [ "!(*.min).svg", "*.min.svg" ]
          ],
          "sortBy": [ "<%= files[0].file.type %>", "asc" ],
          "titles": {
            "tmplat-icon.svg": "Base",
            "tmplat-icon-mono.svg": "Base, Mono",
            "tmplat-icon-mono-inverse.svg": "Base, Mono, Inverse",
            "tmplat-icon-toolbar.svg": "Base, Toolbar",
            "tmplat-icon-toolbar-inverse.svg": "Base, Toolbar, Inverse",
            "tmplat-icon-small.svg": "Base, Small",
            "tmplat-icon-micro.svg": "Base, Micro"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Wordmarks",
          "type": "asset-feature",
          "dir": "wordmark/**/*/",
          "preview": "!(*.min).svg",
          "files": [
            "*.png",
            [ "!(*.min).svg", "*.min.svg" ]
          ],
          "sortBy": [ "<%= files[0].file.type %>", "asc" ],
          "titles": {
            "tmplat-wordmark.svg": "Base",
            "tmplat-wordmark-inverse.svg": "Base, Inverse"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Logos",
          "type": "asset-feature",
          "dir": "logo/**/*/",
          "preview": "!(*.min).svg",
          "files": [
            "*.png",
            [ "!(*.min).svg", "*.min.svg" ]
          ],
          "sortBy": [ "<%= files[0].file.type %>", "asc" ],
          "titles": {
            "tmplat-logo.svg": "Base",
            "tmplat-logo-inverse.svg": "Base, Inverse"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Banners",
          "type": "asset-feature",
          "dir": "banner/**/*/",
          "preview": "!(*.min).svg",
          "files": [
            "*.png",
            [ "!(*.min).svg", "*.min.svg" ]
          ],
          "sortBy": [ "<%= files[0].file.type %>", "asc" ],
          "titles": {
            "tmplat-banner-marquee.svg": "Marquee, 1400x560 (Chrome Web Store)",
            "tmplat-banner-large.svg": "Large, 920x680 (Chrome Web Store)",
            "tmplat-banner-small.svg": "Small, 440x280 (Chrome Web Store)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "doc": "colors.md",
      "title": "Colors",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": "This document contains the colors that are to be used when representing the <%= config.title %> brand."
        },
        { "type": "toc" },
        {
          "title": "Palette",
          "type": "template",
          "content": "The following colors are recommended to be used:"
        },
        {
          "type": "color-table",
          "colors": [
            {
              "name": "Ink",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#151A24"
            },
            {
              "name": "Ink Soft",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#4A5468"
            },
            {
              "name": "Paper",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#FFFFFF"
            },
            {
              "name": "Gradient Start",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#FF8A3D"
            },
            {
              "name": "Gradient End",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#F5544E"
            },
            {
              "name": "Solid Fallback",
              "format": "hex",
              "value": "#FF7A3D"
            }
          ],
          "columns": [
            {
              "header": "Color",
              "content": "<%= color.name %>"
            },
            {
              "header": "Hex",
              "content": "`<%= color.hex %>`"
            },
            {
              "header": "RGB",
              "content": "<%= color.rgb.join(', ') %>"
            },
            {
              "header": "CMYK",
              "content": "<%= color.cmyk.join(', ') %>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": [
            "The gradient (`Gradient Start` &rarr; `Gradient End`) is used for the icon tile and banners, and is a warm nod to the legacy brown of the original \"Template\" brand. `Solid Fallback` should be used wherever a gradient isn't available."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "doc": "guidelines.md",
      "title": "Guidelines",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": "This document contains guidelines to be followed when representing the <%= config.title %> brand."
        },
        { "type": "toc" },
        {
          "type": "template",
          "title": "Fonts",
          "content": [
            "The wordmark is not set in a typeface &mdash; it's a bespoke, geometric, monolinear construction (round caps/joins, single stroke weight) drawn as vector paths, so it should never be recreated with a font. Use the `wordmark` assets directly instead.",
            "",
            "Where live text is required alongside the mark, such as banner taglines, the following fonts are recommended:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Type",
            "Primary Font",
            "Fallback Fonts"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Sans-serif",
              "[Inter](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter)",
              "Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "template",
          "content": [
            "Convert any live text to outlines before handing an SVG anywhere the font isn't guaranteed to be available; the exported PNGs are unaffected."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "template",
          "title": "Notes & Caveats",
          "content": [
            "* **The mark is stroked, not outlined.** If you scale it non-uniformly, or convert to outlines in another tool, check `stroke-width` still resolves as expected. For a fully self-contained file, run \"stroke to path\" before handing off.",
            "* **The toolbar variant exists for a reason.** The full-detail mark goes mushy below ~32px; use the `icon-stack-toolbar` variant (or the tiled `small` / `micro` variants) rather than scaling the base icon down.",
            "* **Banner PNGs should be exported as 24-bit RGB with no alpha channel** &mdash; that's what the Chrome Web Store requires for promotional images."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "options": {
    "lineSeparator": "lf",
    "assets": {
      "url": "https://raw.githack.com/<%= config.repository.user %>/<%= config.repository.name %>/<%= config.repository.branch %>/<%= file %>"
    },
    "docs": {
      "footer": {
        "type": "template",
        "content": [
          "---",
          "",
          "Copyright © tmplat"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
